.TH RNG_BETWEEN 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
rng_between \- A random float in [lo, hi): spawn positions, particle speeds, timer jitter
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqrng.h\(dq
.BI "float rng_between(uint64_t *s, float lo, float hi);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
A random float in [lo, hi): spawn positions, particle speeds, timer jitter.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
a value from lo up to but not including hi.
.SH MODULE
math (src/engine/math/rng.h)
